    {
      "key": "tc228efb5d5a8df9b",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">What Is Leverage in Forex Trading?</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/how-does-leverage-work-in-forex-trading-and-what-risks-should-traders-know#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/how-does-leverage-work-in-forex-trading-and-what-risks-should-traders-know"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">什么是外汇交易杠杆？</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "tbe44502f53e2853b",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Required Margin = Total Position Value ÷ Leverage</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/how-does-leverage-work-in-forex-trading-and-what-risks-should-traders-know#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/how-does-leverage-work-in-forex-trading-and-what-risks-should-traders-know"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">所需保证金 = 总仓位价值 ÷ 杠杆</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "tff57937b799579a5",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">This example excludes spreads, commissions, financing charges, currency conversion, and other possible costs.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/how-does-leverage-work-in-forex-trading-and-what-risks-should-traders-know#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/how-does-leverage-work-in-forex-trading-and-what-risks-should-traders-know"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">此示例不包括点差、佣金、融资费用、货币兑换和其他可能的成本。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "tff8013460be6eaa8",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">What Is the Difference Between Leverage and Margin?</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/how-does-leverage-work-in-forex-trading-and-what-risks-should-traders-know#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/how-does-leverage-work-in-forex-trading-and-what-risks-should-traders-know"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">杠杆和保证金有什么区别？</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t836b53a6002a38f0",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">2. Margin Calls and Automatic Position Closure</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/how-does-leverage-work-in-forex-trading-and-what-risks-should-traders-know#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/how-does-leverage-work-in-forex-trading-and-what-risks-should-traders-know"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">2。追加保证金和自动平仓</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "tb1d60a7ea2080ff8",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">A margin call can occur when the available equity in a trading account becomes insufficient to support open positions.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/how-does-leverage-work-in-forex-trading-and-what-risks-should-traders-know#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/how-does-leverage-work-in-forex-trading-and-what-risks-should-traders-know"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">当交易账户中的可用净值不足以支持未平仓头寸时，可能会发生追加保证金通知。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t2cdade63cd4cac85",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Depending on the provider's terms, positions may also be closed automatically when the required margin level is reached.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/how-does-leverage-work-in-forex-trading-and-what-risks-should-traders-know#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/how-does-leverage-work-in-forex-trading-and-what-risks-should-traders-know"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">根据提供商的条款，当达到所需的保证金水平时，头寸也可能会自动平仓。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "td9e7c3e67f570b70",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Used margin:</span><span data-i18n-slot=\"1\"> Funds allocated to support open positions.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/how-does-leverage-work-in-forex-trading-and-what-risks-should-traders-know#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/how-does-leverage-work-in-forex-trading-and-what-risks-should-traders-know"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">已用保证金：</span><span data-i18n-slot=\"1\">分配用于支持未平仓头寸的资金。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t9e30dd1468004352",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Free margin:</span><span data-i18n-slot=\"1\"> Funds available for opening additional positions or absorbing losses.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/how-does-leverage-work-in-forex-trading-and-what-risks-should-traders-know#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/how-does-leverage-work-in-forex-trading-and-what-risks-should-traders-know"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">可用保证金：</span><span data-i18n-slot=\"1\">可用于开立额外头寸或吸收损失的资金。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "tbe0e4556f5c4665c",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Margin level:</span><span data-i18n-slot=\"1\"> A measure comparing account equity with used margin.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/how-does-leverage-work-in-forex-trading-and-what-risks-should-traders-know#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/how-does-leverage-work-in-forex-trading-and-what-risks-should-traders-know"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">保证金水平：</span><span data-i18n-slot=\"1\">比较帐户净值与已用保证金的衡量标准。</span>"
    },
